Testing conditional statements (haddii):
  age = 20
  Simple if statement:
    Person is an adult
  If-else statement:
    Person cannot drink alcohol
  score = 85
  If-else if-else statement:
    Grade: B
  Nested if statements:
    Person can drive
    Person can vote
  x = 10, y = 20
  Using AND (&&) operator:
    Both conditions are true
  Using OR (||) operator:
    At least one condition is true
  temperature = 37.5
  Testing with decimal values:
    Person has a slight temperature
